Subject: [PATCH 3/6] Add English report and BioCLIP/DINOv3 rerun of
 vector-only meeting experiments

- Recover BioCLIP 2.5 and DINOv3 strict raw vectors from Drive into data/embeddings/
  (SHA-256 recorded in DATA_CATALOG and common.py; image_ids/splits match the manifest)
- FGV_MODEL switch in common.py; run_models.sh reruns items 1/4/5/6/7 into results/<model>/
- index_en.html (English) and a three-model appendix in both reports
- exp5: axis reading says 'no clear organ correlate' when all |rho| < 0.2

